<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

32
00:01:21,850 --> 00:01:28,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

33
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:56,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. Sakura, you've come, too.</font>

34
00:01:59,390 --> 00:02:03,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now you can formally register
for the Chunin Exam.</font>

35
00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:06,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

36
00:02:06,810 --> 00:02:09,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually, from the start,</font>

37
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:14,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">only three-man teams could
apply and take the exams.</font>

38
00:02:15,190 --> 00:02:17,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Sensei, you said that the decision
to take the exams</font>

39
00:02:17,990 --> 00:02:19,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was up to the individual.</font>

40
00:02:20,070 --> 00:02:21,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... I said that.</font>

41
00:02:22,410 --> 00:02:23,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Were you lying?</font>

42
00:02:24,870 --> 00:02:26,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, I was...</font>

43
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I said that,</font>

44
00:02:30,380 --> 00:02:34,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke and Naruto would probably
forcefully convince you to take it.</font>

45
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:39,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you didn't have
the will to apply,</font>

46
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:41,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if Sasuke asks you</font>

47
00:02:41,550 --> 00:02:44,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you would attempt to take
the exams half-heartedly.</font>

48
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:49,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For Sasuke's sake and,
well, Naruto's.</font>

49
00:02:49,730 --> 00:02:50,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, if...</font>

50
00:02:50,940 --> 00:02:54,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it had only been Sasuke-kun and
Naruto who had come here?</font>

51
00:02:54,820 --> 00:02:56,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would've stopped the Exam here.</font>

52
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:59,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wouldn't have felt like letting
them go beyond this point.</font>

53
00:03:00,740 --> 00:03:03,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... you guys came here
on your own will.</font>

54
00:03:04,870 --> 00:03:05,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

55
00:03:07,330 --> 00:03:08,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

56
00:03:09,660 --> 00:03:10,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, Sasuke!</font>

57
00:03:14,130 --> 00:03:15,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm glad you came.</font>

58
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:18,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a team I'm proud of.</font>

59
00:03:19,760 --> 00:03:21,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, go on!</font>

60
00:03:22,180 --> 00:03:23,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Let's go!</font>

61
00:03:48,750 --> 00:03:54,710
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Defeat the Rivals!</font>

62
00:03:48,750 --> 00:03:54,710
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">All 9 Rookies have Assembled</font>

63
00:03:55,500 --> 00:03:57,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wow!</font>

64
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:01,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's with... this?</font>

65
00:04:08,010 --> 00:04:09,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are so many of them...</font>

66
00:04:10,060 --> 00:04:12,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that they're all applicants?</font>

67
00:04:19,030 --> 00:04:22,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They... all look... immensely strong...</font>

68
00:04:24,860 --> 00:04:26,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun, you're late!</font>

69
00:04:29,700 --> 00:04:33,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought I'd be able to see you
for the first time in awhile,</font>

70
00:04:33,250 --> 00:04:35,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so I was waiting in excitement.</font>

71
00:04:38,540 --> 00:04:41,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get away from Sasuke-kun!
Ino Pig!</font>

72
00:04:41,170 --> 00:04:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, my. It's Sakura-chan.</font>

73
00:04:43,470 --> 00:04:46,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your Billboard Brow hasn't changed, eh...
Ugly!</font>

74
00:04:46,470 --> 00:04:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?!</font>

75
00:04:51,890 --> 00:04:52,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with this?</font>

76
00:04:52,890 --> 00:04:53,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

77
00:04:53,770 --> 00:04:57,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you guys going to take
this bothersome Exam, too?</font>

78
00:04:57,690 --> 00:04:59,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's the idiot trio.</font>

79
00:04:59,730 --> 00:05:01,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Quit calling us that!</font>

80
00:05:01,650 --> 00:05:03,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, this is a freaking bother...</font>

81
00:05:04,610 --> 00:05:05,820
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45">Nara</font>

82
00:05:04,610 --> 00:05:05,820
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45">Shikamaru</font>

83
00:05:06,070 --> 00:05:08,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Always complaining,
has no motivation.</font>

84
00:05:09,030 --> 00:05:10,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a bellyaching idiot.</font>

85
00:05:15,410 --> 00:05:16,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45">Akimichi</font>

86
00:05:15,410 --> 00:05:16,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45">Choji</font>

87
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's always eating something.</font>

88
00:05:18,710 --> 00:05:20,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's all he is, a fat idiot.</font>

89
00:05:21,420 --> 00:05:24,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... is mine. Bleah!</font>

90
00:05:25,300 --> 00:05:26,430
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45">Yamanaka</font>

91
00:05:25,300 --> 00:05:26,430
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45">Ino</font>

92
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:30,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's always fighting with Sakura-chan.
She's her rival.</font>

93
00:05:30,970 --> 00:05:32,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Sasuke-crazy idiot.</font>

94
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:34,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yahoo, I found you!</font>

95
00:05:35,230 --> 00:05:38,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My my, everybody's here.</font>

96
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:40,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hello...</font>

97
00:05:40,770 --> 00:05:41,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

98
00:05:43,940 --> 00:05:45,030
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45">Hyuga</font>

99
00:05:43,940 --> 00:05:45,030
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45">Hinata</font>

100
00:05:45,490 --> 00:05:48,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's a weird person who turns
her eyes away whenever I look at her!</font>

101
00:05:48,530 --> 00:05:51,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's a gloomy and shy girl, I guess.</font>

102
00:05:54,660 --> 00:05:56,830
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45">Inuzuka</font>

103
00:05:54,660 --> 00:05:56,830
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45">Kiba</font>

104
00:05:54,660 --> 00:05:56,830
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45">&</font>

105
00:05:54,660 --> 00:05:56,830
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45">Akamaru</font>

106
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:58,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're louder than I am!</font>

107
00:05:58,710 --> 00:06:01,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He always brings his dog and
always has a bossy look.</font>

108
00:06:01,500 --> 00:06:02,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He really annoys me!</font>

109
00:06:05,300 --> 00:06:06,590
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45">Aburame</font>

110
00:06:05,300 --> 00:06:06,590
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45">Shino</font>

111
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:10,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for this guy, I really don't get him!</font>

112
00:06:11,260 --> 00:06:13,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a type I'm not good with.</font>

113
00:06:13,470 --> 00:06:15,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?</font>

114
00:06:15,100 --> 00:06:17,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys, too?!
Man.</font>

115
00:06:18,060 --> 00:06:19,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ha! I see.</font>

116
00:06:20,020 --> 00:06:23,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This means all nine Genin rookies
are taking the Exam, eh...!</font>

117
00:06:24,070 --> 00:06:24,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then...</font>

118
00:06:24,900 --> 00:06:27,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How far can we go?</font>

119
00:06:27,190 --> 00:06:28,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eh... Sasuke-kun?</font>

120
00:06:29,070 --> 00:06:29,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph!...</font>

121
00:06:29,860 --> 00:06:31,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're mighty confident, Kiba.</font>

122
00:06:32,030 --> 00:06:34,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've trained a great deal, so...</font>

123
00:06:34,700 --> 00:06:36,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We won't lose to you guys!</font>

124
00:06:36,540 --> 00:06:38,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

125
00:06:38,620 --> 00:06:42,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know about Sasuke,
but I sure won't lose to the likes of you!</font>

126
00:06:42,380 --> 00:06:44,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry. Naruto-kun...</font>

127
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:47,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba-kun didn't mean it like that...</font>

128
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:48,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

129
00:06:52,430 --> 00:06:55,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru, you've become
tasty-looking...</font>

130
00:07:00,650 --> 00:07:01,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

131
00:07:08,860 --> 00:07:10,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Don't step on it.
— Huh?</font>

132
00:07:11,570 --> 00:07:12,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said, don't step on it.</font>

133
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:14,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're... gonna eat that?</font>

134
00:07:18,330 --> 00:07:19,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you guys!</font>

135
00:07:20,830 --> 00:07:23,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should be a little quieter.</font>

136
00:07:24,170 --> 00:07:29,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are the "rookie nine"...
fresh out of the academy, right?</font>

137
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:34,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Carrying on like that
with cute faces... Man.</font>

138
00:07:35,220 --> 00:07:36,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't a field trip.</font>

139
00:07:37,350 --> 00:07:39,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're you? Acting all haughty!</font>

140
00:07:39,890 --> 00:07:43,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Yakushi Kabuto.
Anyway, take a good look around you.</font>

141
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:08,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Behind you...
They're from the Rain Village.</font>

142
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:09,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're hot-tempered.</font>

143
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:12,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone's tense before the Exam.</font>

144
00:08:13,340 --> 00:08:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought I'd warn you guys
before you get your butts whipped...</font>

145
00:08:20,980 --> 00:08:22,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess it can't be helped.</font>

146
00:08:22,270 --> 00:08:25,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're rookies who don't know
left from right...</font>

147
00:08:26,110 --> 00:08:28,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You remind me of my old self.</font>

148
00:08:28,900 --> 00:08:31,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're Kabuto-san... right?</font>

149
00:08:31,690 --> 00:08:32,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

150
00:08:32,700 --> 00:08:34,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, is this your second time?</font>

151
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

152
00:08:36,990 --> 00:08:38,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's my seventh time.</font>

153
00:08:38,580 --> 00:08:39,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

154
00:08:39,870 --> 00:08:44,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Exam is only held twice a year,
so it's now my fourth year.</font>

155
00:08:44,580 --> 00:08:48,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then that means you know
a lot about these exams?!</font>

156
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:49,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kind of...</font>

157
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:52,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No kidding.
Kabuto-san, you're pretty awesome, huh?</font>

158
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you haven't passed.</font>

159
00:08:54,970 --> 00:08:57,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, well, that is the case, yes...</font>

160
00:08:59,010 --> 00:09:02,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is the Chunin Exam that high a hurdle?</font>

161
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:05,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, this is utterly bothersome...</font>

162
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:10,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, maybe I'll give a bit of
information to my cute juniors.</font>

163
00:09:11,610 --> 00:09:13,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With these Ninja Info Cards.</font>

164
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:15,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Info Cards...?</font>

165
00:09:15,910 --> 00:09:17,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To put it simply,</font>

166
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:21,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they're cards that have information burned
into them and coded with Chakra.</font>

167
00:09:23,870 --> 00:09:28,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I spent four whole years gathering
information for this Exam.</font>

168
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:31,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are close to two hundred
of these cards.</font>

169
00:09:32,340 --> 00:09:34,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are pure white to the eye...</font>

170
00:09:35,050 --> 00:09:37,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To open the data on these cards...</font>

171
00:09:38,260 --> 00:09:39,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing?</font>

172
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:41,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The way it works is that
no one can see the info</font>

173
00:09:41,640 --> 00:09:43,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without using my Chakra...</font>

174
00:09:44,180 --> 00:09:45,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For example... Like this...</font>

175
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:50,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whoa, awesome!
What information is this?</font>

176
00:09:51,190 --> 00:09:53,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The number of test-takers and
participating nations,</font>

177
00:09:53,820 --> 00:09:56,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the number of applicants
from each respective village</font>

178
00:09:56,820 --> 00:10:00,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is individually displayed.</font>

179
00:10:01,740 --> 00:10:03,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you think that</font>

180
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:05,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Chunin Exam is jointly
conducted in the first place?</font>

181
00:10:12,750 --> 00:10:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's said it's done to deepen
friendship among nations first</font>

182
00:10:16,420 --> 00:10:20,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and to boost the Shinobi levels, second.</font>

183
00:10:21,970 --> 00:10:23,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"It's said"?</font>

184
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:24,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

185
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:29,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The real aim is in the checking of
Shinobi levels of neighboring nations</font>

186
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:32,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and keeping power balance equal.</font>

187
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:35,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Power... Equal?</font>

188
00:10:37,700 --> 00:10:40,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why such bothersome things?</font>

189
00:10:43,370 --> 00:10:44,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's not done,</font>

190
00:10:44,580 --> 00:10:47,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the weak nations will be invaded by
the strong nations in no time at all</font>

191
00:10:47,870 --> 00:10:49,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and may end up being
controlled unilaterally.</font>

192
00:10:50,580 --> 00:10:55,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a point to mutual supervision.
Probably.</font>

193
00:10:56,260 --> 00:10:57,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph...</font>

194
00:10:57,300 --> 00:10:58,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of those cards,</font>

195
00:10:58,670 --> 00:11:01,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are there ones with
detailed individual information?</font>

196
00:11:02,340 --> 00:11:03,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, there are...</font>

197
00:11:03,930 --> 00:11:05,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are there ones you're concerned about?</font>

198
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:07,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, there are!</font>

199
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:12,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The information for the applicants
this time around is not perfect,</font>

200
00:11:13,020 --> 00:11:14,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but is burned in and saved.</font>

201
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:17,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys included...</font>

202
00:11:17,740 --> 00:11:21,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">About those "ones you're
concerned about," who you know.</font>

203
00:11:21,410 --> 00:11:24,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anything's fine, tell me their information
and I'll retrieve it for you.</font>

204
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara of the Sand Village,
and Rock Lee of the Leaf Village.</font>

205
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:32,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, you even know names.</font>

206
00:11:32,790 --> 00:11:34,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That makes it quick.</font>

207
00:11:45,220 --> 00:11:46,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here they are!</font>

208
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:48,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please show me.</font>

209
00:11:57,230 --> 00:11:57,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here they are.</font>

210
00:11:59,650 --> 00:12:00,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please show me.</font>

211
00:12:05,870 --> 00:12:09,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't really get what's going on,
but I'll pretend like I do.</font>

212
00:12:10,250 --> 00:12:12,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then, first is Rock Lee.</font>

213
00:12:18,130 --> 00:12:20,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's one year older than you guys.</font>

214
00:12:21,630 --> 00:12:25,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His mission experience,
twenty D-ranks and eleven C-ranks.</font>

215
00:12:26,140 --> 00:12:27,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His squad leader is Guy...</font>

216
00:12:27,810 --> 00:12:30,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In just this year, his Taijutsu
has drastically improved, but...</font>

217
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:32,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His other skills are not good at all.</font>

218
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:38,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Last year, he'd attracted attention as
a Genin rookie with his ability,</font>

219
00:12:38,860 --> 00:12:41,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but didn't participate
in the Chunin Exam.</font>

220
00:12:42,610 --> 00:12:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is his first time taking the exams,
same as you guys...</font>

221
00:12:46,660 --> 00:12:49,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten and Hyuga Neji are on his team...</font>

222
00:12:53,830 --> 00:12:56,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Hyuga?</font>

223
00:12:57,290 --> 00:12:59,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next... is Gaara of the Desert.</font>

224
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:10,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His mission experience,
eight C-ranks. B-ranks...</font>

225
00:13:10,260 --> 00:13:13,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow, one B-rank as a Genin, eh...</font>

226
00:13:13,770 --> 00:13:15,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a Shinobi from a different land
and is a rookie,</font>

227
00:13:15,730 --> 00:13:17,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so there is no further
detailed information.</font>

228
00:13:18,900 --> 00:13:19,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

229
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:24,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems he has returned from
all of his missions uninjured.</font>

230
00:13:25,700 --> 00:13:29,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-rank as a Genin...
But uninjured...?!</font>

231
00:13:30,950 --> 00:13:32,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this guy?</font>

232
00:13:43,630 --> 00:13:48,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf, Sand, Rain, Grass,
Waterfall, Sound...</font>

233
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:52,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are lots of exceptional Genin
from those villages</font>

234
00:13:52,100 --> 00:13:54,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who have come to take
the Exam this year as well.</font>

235
00:13:56,310 --> 00:13:59,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As far as the Village Hidden
in Sound goes,</font>

236
00:13:59,150 --> 00:14:02,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's a village of a small nation that
just sprang up in recent years,</font>

237
00:14:02,150 --> 00:14:03,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so there isn't much information...</font>

238
00:14:07,650 --> 00:14:09,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At any rate,</font>

239
00:14:09,160 --> 00:14:11,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they're all Hidden Villages
with nothing but crackerjacks.</font>

240
00:14:11,990 --> 00:14:15,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kind of makes you lose
your confidence.</font>

241
00:14:16,040 --> 00:14:18,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you saying that now?</font>

242
00:14:18,420 --> 00:14:19,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words...</font>

243
00:14:19,330 --> 00:14:21,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all of the applicants who
have gathered here...</font>

244
00:14:22,170 --> 00:14:23,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

245
00:14:23,250 --> 00:14:25,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not just Lee and Gaara,</font>

246
00:14:25,340 --> 00:14:29,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but they're all choice top elite
Genin from each nation.</font>

247
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:30,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm.</font>

248
00:14:31,430 --> 00:14:33,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't going to be easy.</font>

249
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:38,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't go along with this!</font>

250
00:14:38,390 --> 00:14:40,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They may be your subordinates now,</font>

251
00:14:40,810 --> 00:14:43,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but they are children
who were my students.</font>

252
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:44,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's about them I know...</font>

253
00:14:44,730 --> 00:14:47,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's as you say, Iruka.</font>

254
00:14:48,900 --> 00:14:50,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not going to be that easy.</font>

255
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:52,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're too eager.</font>

256
00:14:53,370 --> 00:14:56,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I postponed my team's test-taking
for one year</font>

257
00:14:56,410 --> 00:14:58,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and took care to build up
their skills.</font>

258
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:01,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have them take the Exam after
they've enjoyed their life a little bit more.</font>

259
00:15:02,170 --> 00:15:03,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph...</font>

260
00:15:03,130 --> 00:15:05,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They might be too easygoing.</font>

261
00:15:05,460 --> 00:15:09,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But they will surpass
your guys in no time.</font>

262
00:15:10,760 --> 00:15:12,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's enough.</font>

263
00:15:13,260 --> 00:15:15,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's as far as
the rookie matter goes.</font>

264
00:15:15,970 --> 00:15:17,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, next...</font>

265
00:15:17,520 --> 00:15:20,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take recommendations for Genin
other than rookies.</font>

266
00:15:22,270 --> 00:15:24,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well! Don't pour cold water on this...</font>

267
00:15:27,690 --> 00:15:29,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said that, nevertheless...</font>

268
00:15:29,780 --> 00:15:34,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if even the fearless ones
are frightened just this time around.</font>

269
00:15:35,870 --> 00:15:37,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stubborn as he is,</font>

270
00:15:37,620 --> 00:15:39,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he's still consumed by this atmosphere
and number of people.</font>

271
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's tense.</font>

272
00:15:42,040 --> 00:15:43,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped.</font>

273
00:15:43,540 --> 00:15:48,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though everyone is a Genin,
we're the newest most inexperienced rookies.</font>

274
00:15:49,510 --> 00:15:52,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm very, very uneasy.</font>

275
00:15:52,930 --> 00:15:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

276
00:15:54,340 --> 00:15:57,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's kind of tough looking at
Naruto who's not himself.</font>

277
00:15:58,810 --> 00:16:00,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe I'll cheer him up a bit.</font>

278
00:16:01,730 --> 00:16:04,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say... Naruto! Don't be so scared.</font>

279
00:16:04,900 --> 00:16:05,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

280
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:17,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name's Uzumaki Naruto!</font>

281
00:16:17,780 --> 00:16:21,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose to any of you!
Got it?!</font>

282
00:16:25,830 --> 00:16:28,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! What's with him?!</font>

283
00:16:29,250 --> 00:16:31,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That idiot would never
get depressed! Absurd!</font>

284
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:34,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It won't do any good to
provoke everyone!</font>

285
00:16:34,380 --> 00:16:35,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell me!</font>

286
00:16:35,550 --> 00:16:37,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I don't tell it to you,
who do I tell it to?!</font>

287
00:16:37,430 --> 00:16:38,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?!</font>

288
00:16:38,680 --> 00:16:41,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I feel better.</font>

289
00:16:42,060 --> 00:16:42,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph...</font>

290
00:16:49,980 --> 00:16:52,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that the guy from before...?</font>

291
00:16:52,860 --> 00:16:55,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The dog's bark is
bigger than its bite.</font>

292
00:16:55,950 --> 00:16:56,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he an idiot...?</font>

293
00:16:57,450 --> 00:16:59,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's mighty high-spirited.</font>

294
00:16:59,330 --> 00:17:00,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's hot-headed, eh.</font>

295
00:17:01,330 --> 00:17:04,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee, maybe you did
not bully him enough.</font>

296
00:17:09,340 --> 00:17:10,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you hear?</font>

297
00:17:10,550 --> 00:17:14,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sound Village is a minor
Hidden Village of a small nation.</font>

298
00:17:14,510 --> 00:17:16,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's offensive.</font>

299
00:17:16,180 --> 00:17:19,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe I'll... play with them a bit.</font>

300
00:17:19,600 --> 00:17:24,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, being referred to as something
like leftover Shinobi and all.</font>

301
00:17:25,310 --> 00:17:27,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll add this to his data.</font>

302
00:17:28,190 --> 00:17:32,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those Sound Shinobi
are brutal in their own way.</font>

303
00:17:41,290 --> 00:17:43,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose to any of you,
you say?</font>

304
00:17:44,040 --> 00:17:45,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said it...!</font>

305
00:17:45,710 --> 00:17:46,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That idiot...</font>

306
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:50,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In no time at all, he's made enemies
of his surroundings.</font>

307
00:17:51,040 --> 00:17:52,960
